    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2024 07:02:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>音乐的力量是无穷大的，哪怕很多平凡的场景，音乐都能赋予他深厚的意义，因此我们选择用音乐为人生策展。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a>失恋时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>highlight&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>weeding歌单&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a>30岁，我要野心勃勃&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>传达给世界的最后声音，我的葬礼&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐往往触及心灵，但带上耳机，就是我和我的对话</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单里也藏着不为外人道也的很多秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>记录着你每一给情绪翻涌的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一首都是你的独家记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM🎵：This is me</span></p>]]></description>
